WEBVTT

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:26.500
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:30.480
Gourmet Hunters are explorers

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.910
who travel the world, searching 
for your ingredients.

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:38.220
And the ingredient at the top of this world

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.280
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:43.450
by one Gourmet Hunter...

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:51.960
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:58.600
Go! Shock!!

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.270
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:06.080
Friends who share the same future

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:08.710
With you guys

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:11.880
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.320
If we join forces

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:17.320
We’ll be invincible

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:20.930
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:28.500
Delicious food gives life

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:34.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:36.070
Let’s eat!!

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:39.080
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:42.080
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:47.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:50.320
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:54.330
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:58.160
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:01.130
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:05.070
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:07.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:15.950
How are the recovery efforts going?

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:17.350
Well.

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:20.650
With 10,000 gourmet construction workers

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:23.790
and gourmet carpenters working 
at astonishing speed,

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:27.030
93% of city functions are 
back the way they were

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:30.830
before the Four-Beasts' attack.

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:33.360
I didn't expect we'd be that far along!

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:36.030
I put it down to the chefs' back-up.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:40.710
Chefs from all over are cooking 
on-site for the workers,

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:44.110
while Setsuno-sama has 
provided her ultimate ramen,

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:47.350
cup ramen made from All-noodles.

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:51.880
So if their stomachs are 
satisfied by delicious food,

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:54.420
they can do good work.

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:00.160
And how are the preparations 
for the festival?

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:02.330
I mean for the Cooking Festival, of course.

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:06.030
Of the Gourmet Hunters asked to 
capture ingredients for the fest,

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:11.370
Zebra refused to help, but the 
rest of the Four Kings agreed.

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:15.270
Toriko was asked?! Then I'm going with him!

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:16.940
No, you're not!

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:21.150
You're not leaving this place 
'til you tame these Beasts.

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:24.550
Calm down!

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:28.390
Rin,

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:31.220
we need to prepare for the fest as well.

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:34.790
I strongly disagree with my marching orders!

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:38.000
Did you just call me a handsome dandy?!

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.960
Not even close!

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:43.500
Oh, come on! I wanna go 
on a trip with Toriko!

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:45.170
I believe you're too late.

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:49.070
Toriko-sama has already left.

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:52.040
I never thought we'd come back here.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:56.250
Yep. Baron Archipelago. 
It's been a long time, huh?

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:03.720
Toriko vs. the Monster of 
the Gourmet World, Mon Plan!

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:11.660
Capturing the Garara Gator...

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:15.200
This was our first trip together, huh?

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:20.270
And after that, we went to 
even more dangerous regions.

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:25.440
It's still scary!

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:28.680
Well, I don't blame you for bein' scared.

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:33.080
Our prey this time is one tough mother.

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:36.220
The Four-Beasts came from the Gourmet World.

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:40.890
And a type of Plant Beast 
hitched a ride with it.

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:42.860
Now it's budding.

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:46.630
A-A Plant Beast from the Gourmet World?!

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:48.700
Just hearing that makes me shiver!

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.070
Well, it's strong,

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:52.870
but as an ingredient for the Cooking Fest,

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:54.840
you couldn't ask for more.

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:58.310
Well...

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:04.880
What's the story behind that 
obviously reluctant face?

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:06.280
Oh...

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:09.350
I'm overjoyed about being able 
to participate in the fest...

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.820
Then why the face?

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:16.530
I'm unsure of whether I have what it 
takes to be in the Cooking Festival.

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:21.600
Hey! You simplified the way 
to make Medicinal Mochi

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:23.500
and saved the human race!

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.900
Have more confidence in yourself!

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:30.640
But Setsuno-san and Meal King 
Yuda-san are participants!

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:33.580
I don't have any confidence!

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:37.150
I'm so full of nervousness and 
anxiety, there's no room left for it.

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:40.750
<i>You'll</i> be fine.

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:44.120
What do you mean <i>I'll</i> be fine?

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:48.160
Let's meet at the festival.

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:53.930
The festival...

00:05:53.930 --> 00:05:56.700
Starjun will be there too.

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:59.600
But will I be able to beat him now?

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:07.910
Flying Knife!

00:06:14.050 --> 00:06:16.520
Impressive, Toriko-san.

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:18.520
T-Takimaru!

00:06:19.220 --> 00:06:22.190
Yes. It's been a while.

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:27.470
Yeesh! You never change.

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:31.800
All you Gourmet Knights sure 
have a violent way of sayin' hi!

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:34.670
My apologies, Toriko.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.470
It was my idea.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:40.810
I wanted to see the true ability of 
the man who beat the Four-Beasts.

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.610
Aimaru-san!

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:45.120
You look well, Ai.

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:47.650
And if you are in tip-top shape,

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:50.920
we could've used your help 
taking down the Four-Beasts.

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:55.230
I thought you Four Kings could handle it.

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:58.760
We just came out now to 
deal with the aftermath.

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:01.770
I see. And by aftermath, you mean...

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:03.300
Yeah.

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:06.340
The Plant Beast that was 
attached to the Four-Beasts.

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:08.470
That's what you're after too, isn't it?

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:15.410
W-What's that voice?!

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:18.480
Probably the Plant Beast 
of the Gourmet World.

00:07:20.550 --> 00:07:22.450
Shall we go together?

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:23.790
To capture it?

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:26.820
Capture it with you, eh?

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:29.630
How many years has it been?

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:33.870
Well, don't fall behind. I wouldn't 
think twice about ditching you.

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:36.630
You're the one who'd better not fall behind.

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:39.800
After all, your body is 
heavy from eating too much.

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:41.140
What was that?!

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:44.610
Aimaru-san is always cool,

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:47.850
but his personality changes 
when he's with Toriko-san.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:51.150
That's because they're old friends.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:53.790
It shows how close they are, right?

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:58.260
At any rate, it's awfully quiet around here.

00:07:58.260 --> 00:07:59.120
Yes.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:04.700
My bet is the Plant Beast devoured all the 
creatures living on Baron Archipelago.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.730
U-Um...

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:11.070
What is this Plant Beast like exactly?

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:13.570
You know what a burr is, right?

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:18.340
You mean those prickly seeds?

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:21.450
Cockleburs are the most common kind, right?

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:24.680
The thorns get caught on an animal's fur

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:26.280
and get carried a long distance.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:29.450
Then they start to sprout.

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:33.930
Yes. This Plant Beast falls 
under the same principle.

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:39.000
It was stuck to the Four-Beasts' body 
and came along to the Human World.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.330
And there you have it.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.530
Toriko!

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:45.270
You didn't even explain that to him?!

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:48.110
Komatsu-kun is your partner, isn't he?

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:51.940
I know! I was planning on telling him later!

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:54.410
As long as we catch the thing, you 
got nothin' to complain about!

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:57.120
There they go again...

00:08:57.580 --> 00:09:02.990
At this rate, it'll eat its way through 
all nature in the Human World.

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:05.760
We have to stop it, no matter what.

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:12.360
We Gourmet Knights always revere 
nature and give it our gratitude.

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:15.070
We can't stay silent and watch

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:18.340
as this nature disappears 
before our very eyes.

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:24.810
Is that why even Aimaru-san, the leader 
of the Gourmet Knights, has come too?

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:28.150
That's not the only reason...

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:32.950
Actually, he came to see Toriko-san.

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:37.160
He heard the rumor that 
the Four Kings were asked

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:39.590
to capture ingredients for the fest.

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:44.660
Death Falls. It's been a while.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:48.570
Thanks to the Four-Beasts' attack,

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:51.670
the mountain that held back 
the falls was demolished...

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:55.610
So I can't enter the caverns 
on the other side of the falls.

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:57.440
Which makes the Mors Oil unreachable...

00:09:58.510 --> 00:10:02.410
Last time, I wouldn't have been able 
to drive back the falls without Toriko,

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:06.220
but with my totally leveled-up power now...

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:08.020
Let's give it a try.

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:14.630
I'd better be able to 
send it flying by myself.

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:16.760
Although it's a lot rougher up ahead.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.500
What's this?

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:28.670
Splendid, Sunny of the Four Kings.

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:30.910
I'm surprised you sensed my presence.

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:33.310
You're in my hair sensors.

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:35.480
Who are you?

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:36.880
Pleased to meet you.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:39.050
I am Wabutora,

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:42.720
the deep-frying chef at Oil King.

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:47.960
I believe I've heard of you. You're the 
one they call Wabutora, the Oil Artisan?

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:50.260
You know of me?

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:51.460
This is an honor.

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:54.270
So what are you doing here?

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:57.100
The kitchen has run out of Mors Oil, you see.

00:10:57.600 --> 00:11:00.440
That oil is absolutely marvelous.

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:05.380
I can make dazzling and delicious 
deep-fried dishes with it.

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:08.410
A chef has come to capture Mors Oil?

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:10.880
Big talk.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:17.220
I'm sorry, but I don't have time 
to chew the fat here. Excuse me.

00:11:17.220 --> 00:11:19.120
Wait a second!

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:22.690
I've been asked to capture Mors Oil too.

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:25.030
I'd ask you not to stand in my way.

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:27.200
Snap, crackle...

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.870
Gourmet Hunter Coco!

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:35.770
It's Coco!

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:40.480
Coco.

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:42.450
Hi, Match.

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:44.420
Long time no see.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:47.190
What the hell are you doin' here?

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:49.220
What?

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:51.490
I thought I'd win some ingredients 
here at the Gourmet Casino

00:11:51.490 --> 00:11:53.760
that can be used at the Cooking Fest.

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:57.630
I can't afford to lose then.

00:11:57.630 --> 00:11:59.760
A non-member IGO nation like ours

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:04.570
has no obligation to provide 
ingredients for an IGO festival.

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:08.740
Still, at my place,

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:11.640
you're gonna gamble to 
capture ingredients, huh?

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:15.810
It's not the kind of capturing 
that requires the use of my body.

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:19.080
W-Wait for me!

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:22.220
I've hit my limit. I can't walk!

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:26.520
Have we arrived?

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:30.400
That's it. I can't take another step.

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.160
Going by that cry,

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:35.100
I think we're in the right area...

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:38.370
But there's no sign of it. Where could it be?

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:42.570
That fragrant scent...

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:44.140
It's methional.

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:47.780
The odor component in many types of potatoes?

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:50.720
Yeah. But that ain't all.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:53.890
It's also the sweet odor 
component in fruit and flan.

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:56.420
And it's coming from underground?!

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:03.860
We're already in its territory!

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:27.090
So this is a Plant Beast 
from the Gourmet World!

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:44.670
Here it comes!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:47.670
Fork Shield!

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:02.090
My Shield...

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:13.830
Flying Fork!

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:29.380
Bottle Opener!

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:45.560
Just as I'd expect from 
a Gourmet World monster!

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:48.230
We'll never finish it like this!

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:53.000
Cutting to the chase, we just 
need to chop it up, right?

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:54.470
Leg Knife!

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:06.220
Yeah!

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:11.890
Toriko-san! Behind you!

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:23.070
Ai! What is this?!

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:25.770
Unless we do something about the main body,

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:28.070
it'll keep shooting out buds to attack us!

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:29.840
I see.

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:32.310
Then the idea is to take 
out the main body, huh?

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:33.980
Ai! Takimaru!

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.810
Take Komatsu over there!

00:15:37.650 --> 00:15:39.250
Leave this thing to me!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:40.050
But...

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:42.020
Takimaru! Toriko's got this!

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:43.220
R-Right!

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:54.400
I've gotten a little stronger too.

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:56.530
Rippin' you out of the ground

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:57.800
should be simple!

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:03.110
What's he doing?!

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:04.710
Here I go!

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:06.310
50-fold...

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:10.750
...Spiked Punch!

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:29.300
50-fold...

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:31.300
It seems after acquiring Honoring 
the Food and Food's End,

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:33.100
and then battling the Four-Beasts,

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:35.140
he's gotten even stronger.

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:37.840
J-Just how strong...

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:39.840
...is Toriko-san?!

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:43.580
Now show yourself!

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:46.480
There you are!

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:58.130
Floating on the surface of the water...

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:01.730
It doesn't look like you have sensors.

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:05.340
Oil repels water.

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:10.680
My body is coated in oil 
and thus repels this water,

00:17:10.680 --> 00:17:12.280
allowing me to float on it. {smp: this show is totally legit 100% science!}

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:15.310
That's an unusual skill.

00:17:15.310 --> 00:17:16.450
But...

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:18.820
...isn't it disgusting 
to be smeared with oil?

00:17:18.820 --> 00:17:21.420
And it sounds like taking care of your 
skin afterwards would be difficult.

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:24.590
But most of all, it isn't beautiful.

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:25.990
What's that?

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:29.630
Aside from that, the idea 
of using oil to drive back

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:33.030
the third-biggest waterfall in the 
world, Death Falls, is ridiculous.

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:36.800
In fact, the joke is that 
you'll be driven back.

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:40.410
It'll truly be "flying oil".

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:42.670
That expression...

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:45.040
You're only adding fuel to the fire.

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:51.280
Fine. I'll show you my power.

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:54.050
I'm seriously going over there!

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:58.060
You can read through the backs of cards,

00:17:58.060 --> 00:18:00.220
so that's no showdown.

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:03.460
We'll go with dice instead.

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:05.630
Anything is fine.

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:08.300
Please check to make sure they're not loaded.

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:15.110
By the way, this country... How 
are things going in Jiddal?

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:21.710
After the king of Jiddal disappeared 
with his exclusive chef, Joie,

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:24.150
chaos continued for a while,

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:28.420
but we in the Gourmet Mafia and the former 
members of the underground cooking world

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.250
managed to calm things down.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:33.390
And the king of Jiddal hasn't returned?

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:35.530
No. Why?

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:38.760
I have to consider every probability.

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:41.100
The Four-Beasts...

00:18:41.730 --> 00:18:43.100
...and...

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:46.740
...the mastermind who 
revived the Four-Beasts.

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:49.070
Mastermind?

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:52.180
Matching dice...

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:55.150
The chances for that 
probability are one in six.

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:58.880
Along the same lines, it's easy to think

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:01.350
there's a connection between the 
mastermind and Gourmet Corp.

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:09.960
The mastermind is Gourmet Corp...

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.830
Or it's something else...

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:26.340
Four-Beasts bastard...

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:30.720
You demolished the place.

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:42.760
Long time no see,

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:47.900
Salamander Sphinx.

00:20:05.150 --> 00:20:07.350
A burr monster?!

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:10.190
That's the Plant Beast's true form...

00:20:10.190 --> 00:20:11.520
Monster Plant!

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:15.660
Monster Plant
Nickname: Mon Plan (Plant Beast)
Capture Level: 118

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:15.060
Or "Mon Plan" for short!

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:21.970
Mon Plan sounds less like a burr 
than a chestnut, doesn't it?

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:23.970
That sure is a chestnut.

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:27.270
The scent of methional 
and flan it's givin' off

00:20:27.270 --> 00:20:29.310
is the odor component of a chestnut!

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:31.740
Fork Shield!

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:34.310
What?!

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:42.420
What kind of shell is that?!

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:45.560
And what kind of delicious treat

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:48.160
is hiding beneath that sharp casing?!

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:53.500
Mon Plan...

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:56.170
I'm glad you came by right 
after the Four-Beasts.

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:09.980
Tomorrow’s wind is gonna blow tomorrow

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:16.820
So your adventurous life will be sensational

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:22.290
Only a smile has no flavor, 
so wipe your tears

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:28.730
After a downpour of rain from the 
sky, the sun always rises high

00:21:28.730 --> 00:21:34.470
Every time I know you’re working up a sweat

00:21:34.470 --> 00:21:40.010
My heart races and I become captivated

00:21:40.010 --> 00:21:49.050
Don’t give up! I’m closest to 
you in the middle of a challenge

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:53.590
Always believe in yourself!

00:22:00.930 --> 00:22:04.040
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:09.170
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:16.710
Hiding Level: 99

00:22:09.170 --> 00:22:11.910
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 99!

00:22:11.910 --> 00:22:14.010
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:14.010 --> 00:22:16.210
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:19.750
A picnic at Death Falls?

00:22:19.750 --> 00:22:23.220
But a Hiding Level of 99!

00:22:23.220 --> 00:22:25.620
That's a heaping helping of hard!

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:29.790
Yun is... right here!

00:22:33.930 --> 00:22:38.700
Century Soup!

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:43.040
Don't tell me he was the rainbow 
coming out of the Century Soup?!

00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:44.480
That's too tough!

00:22:45.240 --> 00:22:49.980
Oh! It seems capturing that ingredient 
is super difficult for Toriko next week!

00:22:52.130 --> 00:22:53.410
Fast, and strong.

00:22:53.410 --> 00:22:56.130
Astonishing power that can break through anything!

00:22:56.130 --> 00:22:59.900
It's the special attack capable of surpassing the Nail Punch!

00:23:00.370 --> 00:23:02.740
Toriko's New Attack, "Nail Gun"

00:23:02.740 --> 00:23:04.720
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
